WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:05,770
In my last life, I have been sitting on the table

2
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:06,810
When something happens to the eldest brother-in-law

3
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:08,010
I'm still playing platoon

4
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:09,450
Three days later, I got off the table

5
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:11,250
Only then did he rush over in a daze and hunger.

6
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,450
I only caught up with my eldest brother-in-law’s funeral.

7
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:16,130
Maybe it’s because I didn’t show up in time with my eldest sister and my eldest sister

8
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,100
He was very cold to me at that time

9
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,660
See yourself unpopular

10
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:21,220
I left after attending the funeral.

11
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:23,140
The eldest sister took the province to the south.

12
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,740
From now on, there is no news

13
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:26,220
It's because of the oppression of the Li family

14
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,980
It's probably because you're completely disappointed in me.

15
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:29,380
Anyone else would be heartbroken

16
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:39,180
Fortunately, I'm here in this life.

17
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:41,950
Zhang Jianguo came to our Lijia Village to beat people.

18
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:43,830
Li Cuoyuan even beat his own uncle

19
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:45,510
It's simply anti-Tiangang

20
00:00:45,510 --> 00:00:46,830
Can't survive

21
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:48,750
Secretary, you have to make the decision for us

22
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:50,950
There is no justice in our Lijiazhuang

23
00:00:50,950 --> 00:00:53,390
There can't be a scum secretary like Li Couyuan

24
00:00:53,390 --> 00:00:55,470
Zhang Jianguo must apologize to us.

25
00:00:55,470 --> 00:00:57,590
Li Cuoyuan had to kowtow to his second uncle and admit his mistake.

26
00:00:57,590 --> 00:00:58,590
Otherwise, Zhang Qiuyue

27
00:00:58,590 --> 00:00:59,630
Don't even think about taking the child with you

28
00:00:59,630 --> 00:01:01,190
Establish a foothold in our home

29
00:01:01,190 --> 00:01:02,710
The old ex-wife thought who would be willing

30
00:01:02,710 --> 00:01:04,990
Stay in your white-eyed wolf's den. I'm coming over today.

31
00:01:04,990 --> 00:01:06,750
Just want to pick up my eldest sister

32
00:01:06,750 --> 00:01:08,510
Zhang Jianguo just has no ability anymore

33
00:01:08,510 --> 00:01:10,430
It’s not like I can’t afford to support my sister and nephew
